## BDD-2 反例 A (S-1 YAML→md 漂移: phases.yaml P2 name 篡改)
命令: check-structure-consistency.py AGATE_ROOT=dist/p6-drift-s1
输出:
S1-phases: ERROR phase P2 name 不一致：phases.yaml='方案设计层-漂移' vs WORKFLOW 表='方案设计层'
S2-workflow: OK
S3-cards: OK
S4-scripts: OK
S5-schema: OK
S6-references: OK
S0-numbers: OK
RAW_EXIT_CODE: 1
## BDD-2 反例 B (S-2 md→YAML 漂移: WORKFLOW 表插入 P9 行)
命令: check-structure-consistency.py AGATE_ROOT=dist/p6-drift-s2
输出:
S1-phases: OK
S2-workflow: ERROR WORKFLOW 总览表阶段 P9 未在 phases.yaml 定义（S-2 md→YAML）
S3-cards: OK
S4-scripts: OK
S5-schema: OK
S6-references: OK
S0-numbers: OK
RAW_EXIT_CODE: 1

